              </h3>
              
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:10px; font-size:0.92rem;">
                <span style="color:var(--color-muted);">المجموع الفرعي:</span>
                <span id="subtotalValSummary2" style="font-weight:700; color:var(--color-primary);">00.00 ج.م</span>
